    "description": {
      "value": "When you hold this sleek, shiny gray wand, you hear a faint chorus of overlapping whispers.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast mind probe. The first time the target rolls a success at a Deception check to mislead your probe, it gets a result one step worse than it rolled.\n\nThis means you learn the answer if the target's Deception check would have succeeded, and you learn nothing rather than believing a falsehood if the check would have been a critical success."
